---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Historical Analysis | InSpectiv Labs"
  description="Access years of archived satellite radar data to establish a comprehensive baseline of ground movement."
>
  <section class="pt-40 pb-20 bg-[#000f2c] text-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light mb-6 tracking-wide">Historical Analysis</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Establish pre-construction baselines and validate historical asset stability using archived satellite data.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-gray-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-[#000f2c] mb-6">Understand Your Ground Truth</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Before deploying capital or breaking ground on major infrastructure and mining projects, it's critical to understand the historical stability of the site. Our Historical Analysis service provides you with a retrospective view of ground movement over months or years.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1d4ed8] mb-4">Key Benefits</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-12">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-[#1d4ed8] text-xl mt-1"></i>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-gray-900 font-semibold">Pre-construction Baselines</strong>
              <span class="text-gray-600 font-light">Accurately document ground conditions before project initiation to protect against future liability claims.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-[#1d4ed8] text-xl mt-1"></i>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-gray-900 font-semibold">Asset Validation</strong>
              <span class="text-gray-600 font-light">Verify the long-term structural health of existing dams, slopes, and infrastructure.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-[#1d4ed8] text-xl mt-1"></i>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-gray-900 font-semibold">Data-Driven Decisions</strong>
              <span class="text-gray-600 font-light">Make informed investment choices with comprehensive risk intelligence.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-lg p-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-800 italic">
            * This is a scaffolded page. Please update this content with your specific marketing copy and case studies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
